        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Trichloromethane, at plant
Inventory for a chemical.;
CAS number: 000067-66-3; 
Synonyms: Methyl trichloride, Chloroform, Refrigerant R20, formyl trichloride, methane trichloride, methenyl trichloride, trichloroform, R 20, r 20 (refrigerant); 
UUID: 31a0a246-a61f-3cab-a004-9ffbbdc41b60
Gate to gate inventory for the production, estimation for infrastructure and not including by-products
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Chemical processing
Time period: Publication date
Production volume: The worldwide production capacity in 1987 for fluoroplastics was ca. 45 000t.
Sampling: Literature, company information, stoichiometric calculations, assumptions. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_31a0a246-a61f-3cab-a004-9ffbbdc41b60.xml</text>
